  ],
  "duration_s": 498.904921,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "前一阵咱们看了不少大好河山，可您发现没有再好看的风景，底下总踩着一座城。今天咱们换个走法，不往山上看，往城里走一走。您说被写进古诗里最多的城市会是哪一座？有人说是杭州光写西湖写钱塘的诗，据统计就有一万两千多首。有人说是南京金陵，秦淮乌衣巷加起来九千多首，对不住了杭州，只能排第二。南京连前二都进不了真正排在榜首的那座城写他的诗，据统计，两万多首比杭州还多出八千多首。他的名字就两个字，在唐宋诗词里，光是这两个字就出现了一万四千多字。今今天咱们就来盘点中国历史上被写进古诗里最多的十大名城。这十座城有没有您家？那座咱们一座一座看，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，收藏起来，省得手一滑，咱们就错过了第十名。苏州古时候叫姑苏，也叫吴忠太湖边上的一座水城，写苏州的诗存世将近三千五百首，最有名的是您小时候背过的那首姑苏城外寒山寺，夜半钟声到客船写诗的张继是个赶路的读书人，船停在枫桥边，睡不着，听见寒山寺半夜敲钟就二十八个字，唐朝写下传到今天寺里。这口钟每年除夕夜还要敲一百零八下，不少人专门赶来，就为听这一下。后来的文人顺着钟声往下写写，小桥写河道，写吴地软软的口音，一写就是三千多首三千多首诗写下来，其实写的不是城有多大，而是奔波了一辈子的普通人，心里头多想，有这么一处能让自己慢下来的江南水乡第九名。成都古时候叫景观城，也叫益州，历代写成都的诗超过三千首。光是杜甫住在这里，几年就一个人写了将近二百五十首。那时候安史之乱爆发，诗圣一路逃难到浣花溪边，盖了三间破草房，写下晓看红湿处花重锦关城说的是清晨推开柴门，满城湿润的落花映红了眼睛，颠沛被琉璃的大半辈子全在成都的绿竹和细雨里被治愈了。您今天去杜甫草堂走一圈，参天，红墙幽深，竹林风吹过来，凉悠悠的。老人们在树荫底下摇着蒲扇喝盖碗茶，还是那个最安生的慢日子。三千首诗写进锦官城，能让流离失所的诗圣写出两百多首安乐诗，您想想，这得是多温暖的一座城。第八名武汉，古时候叫江城，长江和汗水。在这碰头，历代写武昌、汉阳和黄鹤楼的名篇超过三千五百首。崔颢站在蛇山顶上写下黄鹤一去不复返，白云千载空悠悠。意思特明白，神仙早就飞走了，眼前只剩万古不变的悠悠白云，连李白来了都戈壁长叹。长江和汉水在城下碰头，把这里变成水陆枢纽，也成了天下游子告别故土、奔赴远方的第一关口。您登上晴川阁，隔江一望，大江滚滚东流。汽笛一响，心里头那股沉甸甸的乡愁，不用谁多说，自己就涌上来了。三千五百多首送别诗留在这片江面上，江水带走的是离人留下的全是割舍不下的故土。亲情。第七名，岳阳古时候叫巴陵，在八百里洞庭湖边上，历代吟宋岳阳和洞庭湖的名作足足有四千多首。杜甫登岳阳楼写下吴楚东南渡，乾坤日夜浮。胡大的像把吴地和楚地撕开天和地都在水面上，漂那年他五十七岁又老，又病家，就是一条船。两年后。人死在湖南的一条船上，过了二百七十多年范仲淹一句先天下之忧而忧，硬生生把一座楼的风景拔成了中国士大夫的脊梁骨。您今天站在岳阳楼廊檐下，极目望去，水天一色，浪头拍在石矶上，砰砰作响，胸膛自然就跟着挺了起来。四千多首壮阔诗篇立在风浪里。老祖宗宗留给咱们的这四千多绝唱，教的是做人，心里该有的一股骨气。第六名，扬州，古时候叫广陵，京杭大运河边上的老码头，前面四座城写诗的数量都在三四千首到了扬州，一下子蹦到将近八千首，直接翻了一倍。为什么？因为运河南来北往，运盐运到梁的船，都得在扬州靠岸，盐商扎堆李白、杜牧这些大诗人也一波一波的来李白一句烟花三月下扬州，把暮春柳絮写成了天下相王杜牧又添一句二十四桥明月夜，把清冷月光洒满了画法。大唐的豪放，大宋的温暖，大清的富庶文，人们兜里有钱没钱，全把最放浪的笔墨倾倒在瘦西湖的水面上。您今天走上二十四桥，玉带般的水面，泛着涟漪，两岸垂柳依依，那份极尽繁华后的微凉依然扑面而来。将近八千首诗砸在扬州城里，那是古代文人，把最阔绰的春光全掏给了。这里谁读了能不动心？从第十到第六名，是舟在客船里敲响了千年晚钟。成都在草堂绿竹中安顿的流离失圣武汉在长江风浪前送进的天涯游子。岳阳在八百里洞庭边挺直了文人家国，扬州在大运河波光里聚起了八千首风乐，可他们还不是被写进古诗里最多的。接下来第五道第一名更吓人，有个老都城满大街的热闹日子被古人写进了一万多首词里有一座城文豪亲自筑起长堤，写下一万两千首绝唱，可排在榜首的那座城。古人只要一提笔，满篇写下的都是走不出的功名与天下。他是哪座？他凭什么能力压西湖与金陵下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国历史上被写进古诗里最多的名称。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 2810,
      "text": "前一阵咱们看了不少大好河山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3570,
      "end_ms": 6710,
      "text": "可您发现没有再好看的风景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7030,
      "end_ms": 8790,
      "text": "底下总踩着一座城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9570,
      "end_ms": 11190,
      "text": "今天咱们换个走法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11650,
      "end_ms": 12870,
      "text": "不往山上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13410,
      "end_ms": 15030,
      "text": "往城里走一走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15390,
      "end_ms": 20650,
      "text": "您说被写进古诗里最多的城市会是哪一座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20950,
      "end_ms": 25190,
      "text": "有人说是杭州光写西湖写钱塘的诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25590,
      "end_ms": 28310,
      "text": "据统计就有一万两千多首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28690,
      "end_ms": 31040,
      "text": "有人说是南京金陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31380,
      "end_ms": 34860,
      "text": "秦淮乌衣巷加起来九千多首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35660,
      "end_ms": 37320,
      "text": "对不住了杭州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37360,
      "end_ms": 38460,
      "text": "只能排第二。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38940,
      "end_ms": 45580,
      "text": "南京连前二都进不了真正排在榜首的那座城写他的诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00015",
      "start_ms": 46000,
      "end_ms": 46700,
      "text": "据统计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46940,
      "end_ms": 50660,
      "text": "两万多首比杭州还多出八千多首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00017",
      "start_ms": 51280,
      "end_ms": 53180,
      "text": "他的名字就两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00018",
      "start_ms": 53940,
      "end_ms": 55500,
      "text": "在唐宋诗词里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55780,
      "end_ms": 59400,
      "text": "光是这两个字就出现了一万四千多字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00020",
      "start_ms": 59660,
      "end_ms": 65885,
      "text": "今今天咱们就来盘点中国历史上被写进古诗里最多的十大名城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00021",
      "start_ms": 66430,
      "end_ms": 68470,
      "text": "这十座城有没有您家？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00022",
      "start_ms": 68470,
      "end_ms": 70605,
      "text": "那座咱们一座一座看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00023",
      "start_ms": 70930,
      "end_ms": 72710,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00024",
      "start_ms": 72810,
      "end_ms": 73675,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00025",
      "start_ms": 74040,
      "end_ms": 74960,
      "text": "省得手一滑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00026",
      "start_ms": 74980,
      "end_ms": 77305,
      "text": "咱们就错过了第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00027",
      "start_ms": 77830,
      "end_ms": 80555,
      "text": "苏州古时候叫姑苏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00028",
      "start_ms": 81160,
      "end_ms": 85175,
      "text": "也叫吴忠太湖边上的一座水城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86010,
      "end_ms": 90230,
      "text": "写苏州的诗存世将近三千五百首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00030",
      "start_ms": 90630,
      "end_ms": 96725,
      "text": "最有名的是您小时候背过的那首姑苏城外寒山寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00031",
      "start_ms": 97130,
      "end_ms": 103075,
      "text": "夜半钟声到客船写诗的张继是个赶路的读书人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00032",
      "start_ms": 103620,
      "end_ms": 105200,
      "text": "船停在枫桥边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00033",
      "start_ms": 105580,
      "end_ms": 106255,
      "text": "睡不着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00034",
      "start_ms": 106790,
      "end_ms": 111155,
      "text": "听见寒山寺半夜敲钟就二十八个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00035",
      "start_ms": 111480,
      "end_ms": 115290,
      "text": "唐朝写下传到今天寺里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00036",
      "start_ms": 115290,
      "end_ms": 119195,
      "text": "这口钟每年除夕夜还要敲一百零八下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00037",
      "start_ms": 119910,
      "end_ms": 121330,
      "text": "不少人专门赶来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00038",
      "start_ms": 121890,
      "end_ms": 123310,
      "text": "就为听这一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00039",
      "start_ms": 123650,
      "end_ms": 126650,
      "text": "后来的文人顺着钟声往下写写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00040",
      "start_ms": 126690,
      "end_ms": 128230,
      "text": "小桥写河道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00041",
      "start_ms": 128530,
      "end_ms": 130130,
      "text": "写吴地软软的口音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00042",
      "start_ms": 130610,
      "end_ms": 134510,
      "text": "一写就是三千多首三千多首诗写下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00043",
      "start_ms": 134830,
      "end_ms": 136830,
      "text": "其实写的不是城有多大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00044",
      "start_ms": 137250,
      "end_ms": 139770,
      "text": "而是奔波了一辈子的普通人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00045",
      "start_ms": 140350,
      "end_ms": 141450,
      "text": "心里头多想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00046",
      "start_ms": 141510,
      "end_ms": 146770,
      "text": "有这么一处能让自己慢下来的江南水乡第九名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00047",
      "start_ms": 147170,
      "end_ms": 149525,
      "text": "成都古时候叫景观城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00048",
      "start_ms": 150160,
      "end_ms": 151120,
      "text": "也叫益州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00049",
      "start_ms": 151920,
      "end_ms": 154640,
      "text": "历代写成都的诗超过三千首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00050",
      "start_ms": 155400,
      "end_ms": 157220,
      "text": "光是杜甫住在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00051",
      "start_ms": 157240,
      "end_ms": 160800,
      "text": "几年就一个人写了将近二百五十首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00052",
      "start_ms": 161220,
      "end_ms": 162840,
      "text": "那时候安史之乱爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00053",
      "start_ms": 163420,
      "end_ms": 165880,
      "text": "诗圣一路逃难到浣花溪边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00054",
      "start_ms": 166480,
      "end_ms": 168100,
      "text": "盖了三间破草房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00055",
      "start_ms": 168800,
      "end_ms": 175160,
      "text": "写下晓看红湿处花重锦关城说的是清晨推开柴门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00056",
      "start_ms": 175880,
      "end_ms": 178820,
      "text": "满城湿润的落花映红了眼睛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00057",
      "start_ms": 179220,
      "end_ms": 184925,
      "text": "颠沛被琉璃的大半辈子全在成都的绿竹和细雨里被治愈了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00058",
      "start_ms": 185370,
      "end_ms": 187555,
      "text": "您今天去杜甫草堂走一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00059",
      "start_ms": 188000,
      "end_ms": 188440,
      "text": "参天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00060",
      "start_ms": 188500,
      "end_ms": 189780,
      "text": "红墙幽深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00061",
      "start_ms": 189800,
      "end_ms": 191590,
      "text": "竹林风吹过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00062",
      "start_ms": 191590,
      "end_ms": 192435,
      "text": "凉悠悠的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00063",
      "start_ms": 192870,
      "end_ms": 196035,
      "text": "老人们在树荫底下摇着蒲扇喝盖碗茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00064",
      "start_ms": 196470,
      "end_ms": 198735,
      "text": "还是那个最安生的慢日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00065",
      "start_ms": 199150,
      "end_ms": 201555,
      "text": "三千首诗写进锦官城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00066",
      "start_ms": 202140,
      "end_ms": 206595,
      "text": "能让流离失所的诗圣写出两百多首安乐诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00067",
      "start_ms": 207340,
      "end_ms": 208155,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00068",
      "start_ms": 208560,
      "end_ms": 210615,
      "text": "这得是多温暖的一座城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00069",
      "start_ms": 211030,
      "end_ms": 212645,
      "text": "第八名武汉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00070",
      "start_ms": 213380,
      "end_ms": 214745,
      "text": "古时候叫江城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00071",
      "start_ms": 215400,
      "end_ms": 216620,
      "text": "长江和汗水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00072",
      "start_ms": 216660,
      "end_ms": 217445,
      "text": "在这碰头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00073",
      "start_ms": 218140,
      "end_ms": 224005,
      "text": "历代写武昌、汉阳和黄鹤楼的名篇超过三千五百首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00074",
      "start_ms": 224420,
      "end_ms": 228765,
      "text": "崔颢站在蛇山顶上写下黄鹤一去不复返，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00075",
      "start_ms": 229390,
      "end_ms": 231235,
      "text": "白云千载空悠悠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00076",
      "start_ms": 231840,
      "end_ms": 233025,
      "text": "意思特明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00077",
      "start_ms": 233570,
      "end_ms": 235275,
      "text": "神仙早就飞走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00078",
      "start_ms": 235710,
      "end_ms": 238715,
      "text": "眼前只剩万古不变的悠悠白云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00079",
      "start_ms": 239280,
      "end_ms": 241705,
      "text": "连李白来了都戈壁长叹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00080",
      "start_ms": 242140,
      "end_ms": 244535,
      "text": "长江和汉水在城下碰头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00081",
      "start_ms": 245020,
      "end_ms": 246895,
      "text": "把这里变成水陆枢纽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00082",
      "start_ms": 247440,
      "end_ms": 252435,
      "text": "也成了天下游子告别故土、奔赴远方的第一关口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00083",
      "start_ms": 252850,
      "end_ms": 254330,
      "text": "您登上晴川阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00084",
      "start_ms": 254530,
      "end_ms": 255565,
      "text": "隔江一望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00085",
      "start_ms": 255880,
      "end_ms": 257440,
      "text": "大江滚滚东流。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00086",
      "start_ms": 257820,
      "end_ms": 258915,
      "text": "汽笛一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00087",
      "start_ms": 259390,
      "end_ms": 262215,
      "text": "心里头那股沉甸甸的乡愁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00088",
      "start_ms": 262680,
      "end_ms": 263780,
      "text": "不用谁多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00089",
      "start_ms": 264080,
      "end_ms": 265270,
      "text": "自己就涌上来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00090",
      "start_ms": 265760,
      "end_ms": 269295,
      "text": "三千五百多首送别诗留在这片江面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00091",
      "start_ms": 270130,
      "end_ms": 276090,
      "text": "江水带走的是离人留下的全是割舍不下的故土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00092",
      "start_ms": 276110,
      "end_ms": 276605,
      "text": "亲情。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00093",
      "start_ms": 276980,
      "end_ms": 277725,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00094",
      "start_ms": 278090,
      "end_ms": 280785,
      "text": "岳阳古时候叫巴陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00095",
      "start_ms": 281370,
      "end_ms": 283575,
      "text": "在八百里洞庭湖边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00096",
      "start_ms": 284150,
      "end_ms": 289965,
      "text": "历代吟宋岳阳和洞庭湖的名作足足有四千多首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00097",
      "start_ms": 290460,
      "end_ms": 294255,
      "text": "杜甫登岳阳楼写下吴楚东南渡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00098",
      "start_ms": 294610,
      "end_ms": 296065,
      "text": "乾坤日夜浮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00099",
      "start_ms": 296760,
      "end_ms": 302340,
      "text": "胡大的像把吴地和楚地撕开天和地都在水面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00100",
      "start_ms": 302340,
      "end_ms": 305520,
      "text": "漂那年他五十七岁又老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00101",
      "start_ms": 305540,
      "end_ms": 306520,
      "text": "又病家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00102",
      "start_ms": 306540,
      "end_ms": 307635,
      "text": "就是一条船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00103",
      "start_ms": 308160,
      "end_ms": 308895,
      "text": "两年后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00104",
      "start_ms": 309310,
      "end_ms": 311650,
      "text": "人死在湖南的一条船上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00105",
      "start_ms": 312110,
      "end_ms": 317270,
      "text": "过了二百七十多年范仲淹一句先天下之忧而忧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00106",
      "start_ms": 317830,
      "end_ms": 323210,
      "text": "硬生生把一座楼的风景拔成了中国士大夫的脊梁骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00107",
      "start_ms": 323570,
      "end_ms": 326070,
      "text": "您今天站在岳阳楼廊檐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00108",
      "start_ms": 326610,
      "end_ms": 327630,
      "text": "极目望去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00109",
      "start_ms": 327770,
      "end_ms": 328890,
      "text": "水天一色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00110",
      "start_ms": 329470,
      "end_ms": 331050,
      "text": "浪头拍在石矶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00111",
      "start_ms": 331110,
      "end_ms": 331990,
      "text": "砰砰作响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00112",
      "start_ms": 332410,
      "end_ms": 334570,
      "text": "胸膛自然就跟着挺了起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00113",
      "start_ms": 334950,
      "end_ms": 338110,
      "text": "四千多首壮阔诗篇立在风浪里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00114",
      "start_ms": 338510,
      "end_ms": 341840,
      "text": "老祖宗宗留给咱们的这四千多绝唱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00115",
      "start_ms": 342240,
      "end_ms": 343320,
      "text": "教的是做人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00116",
      "start_ms": 343320,
      "end_ms": 345200,
      "text": "心里该有的一股骨气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00117",
      "start_ms": 345600,
      "end_ms": 346280,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00118",
      "start_ms": 346680,
      "end_ms": 347219,
      "text": "扬州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00119",
      "start_ms": 348020,
      "end_ms": 349440,
      "text": "古时候叫广陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00120",
      "start_ms": 350220,
      "end_ms": 352620,
      "text": "京杭大运河边上的老码头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00121",
      "start_ms": 353420,
      "end_ms": 359560,
      "text": "前面四座城写诗的数量都在三四千首到了扬州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00122",
      "start_ms": 360040,
      "end_ms": 362540,
      "text": "一下子蹦到将近八千首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00123",
      "start_ms": 363060,
      "end_ms": 364460,
      "text": "直接翻了一倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00124",
      "start_ms": 364900,
      "end_ms": 365480,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00125",
      "start_ms": 365700,
      "end_ms": 368120,
      "text": "因为运河南来北往，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00126",
      "start_ms": 368240,
      "end_ms": 369750,
      "text": "运盐运到梁的船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00127",
      "start_ms": 370190,
      "end_ms": 371755,
      "text": "都得在扬州靠岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00128",
      "start_ms": 372510,
      "end_ms": 382075,
      "text": "盐商扎堆李白、杜牧这些大诗人也一波一波的来李白一句烟花三月下扬州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00129",
      "start_ms": 382500,
      "end_ms": 390435,
      "text": "把暮春柳絮写成了天下相王杜牧又添一句二十四桥明月夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00130",
      "start_ms": 390820,
      "end_ms": 393705,
      "text": "把清冷月光洒满了画法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00131",
      "start_ms": 394090,
      "end_ms": 395245,
      "text": "大唐的豪放，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00132",
      "start_ms": 395600,
      "end_ms": 396665,
      "text": "大宋的温暖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00133",
      "start_ms": 397000,
      "end_ms": 398580,
      "text": "大清的富庶文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00134",
      "start_ms": 398620,
      "end_ms": 400525,
      "text": "人们兜里有钱没钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00135",
      "start_ms": 400980,
      "end_ms": 405295,
      "text": "全把最放浪的笔墨倾倒在瘦西湖的水面上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00136",
      "start_ms": 405660,
      "end_ms": 407665,
      "text": "您今天走上二十四桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00137",
      "start_ms": 408160,
      "end_ms": 409300,
      "text": "玉带般的水面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00138",
      "start_ms": 409340,
      "end_ms": 410235,
      "text": "泛着涟漪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00139",
      "start_ms": 410710,
      "end_ms": 412165,
      "text": "两岸垂柳依依，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00140",
      "start_ms": 412550,
      "end_ms": 416430,
      "text": "那份极尽繁华后的微凉依然扑面而来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00141",
      "start_ms": 416890,
      "end_ms": 419975,
      "text": "将近八千首诗砸在扬州城里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00142",
      "start_ms": 420500,
      "end_ms": 421820,
      "text": "那是古代文人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00143",
      "start_ms": 421880,
      "end_ms": 425040,
      "text": "把最阔绰的春光全掏给了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00144",
      "start_ms": 425040,
      "end_ms": 427615,
      "text": "这里谁读了能不动心？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00145",
      "start_ms": 427970,
      "end_ms": 429530,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00146",
      "start_ms": 429530,
      "end_ms": 433055,
      "text": "是舟在客船里敲响了千年晚钟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00147",
      "start_ms": 433580,
      "end_ms": 441285,
      "text": "成都在草堂绿竹中安顿的流离失圣武汉在长江风浪前送进的天涯游子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00148",
      "start_ms": 441740,
      "end_ms": 445020,
      "text": "岳阳在八百里洞庭边挺直了文人家国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00149",
      "start_ms": 445460,
      "end_ms": 449145,
      "text": "扬州在大运河波光里聚起了八千首风乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00150",
      "start_ms": 449530,
      "end_ms": 452905,
      "text": "可他们还不是被写进古诗里最多的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00151",
      "start_ms": 453440,
      "end_ms": 455705,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更吓人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00152",
      "start_ms": 456350,
      "end_ms": 467635,
      "text": "有个老都城满大街的热闹日子被古人写进了一万多首词里有一座城文豪亲自筑起长堤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00153",
      "start_ms": 468070,
      "end_ms": 470290,
      "text": "写下一万两千首绝唱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00154",
      "start_ms": 470630,
      "end_ms": 472975,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00155",
      "start_ms": 473640,
      "end_ms": 475275,
      "text": "古人只要一提笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00156",
      "start_ms": 475760,
      "end_ms": 479325,
      "text": "满篇写下的都是走不出的功名与天下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00157",
      "start_ms": 479730,
      "end_ms": 480545,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00158",
      "start_ms": 480990,
      "end_ms": 486435,
      "text": "他凭什么能力压西湖与金陵下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00159",
      "start_ms": 487290,
      "end_ms": 488475,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00160",
      "start_ms": 488900,
      "end_ms": 491835,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1d871674fe185072_s00161",
      "start_ms": 492330,
      "end_ms": 497715,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国历史上被写进古诗里最多的名称。"
    }
  ],
